  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CpWXamx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WlrSbJp.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/gottschsmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/se1ERhJ.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/31YQP9T4H9NI7?ref_=wl_share\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EcaUQMi.png\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgottsch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/39o2rdL.png\"></a></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Это новая базовая библиотека (API), которая используется во всех моих других модах. Она заменяет ModUtilsAPI.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Некоторые моды, которые в настоящее время используют эту библиотеку:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/treasure2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Treasure2!</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/legacyvault\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Legacy Vault</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/protect-it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Protect It</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dungeon-denizens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Denizens</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enemy-echelons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Вражеские эшелоны</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dungeons2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Подземелья 2!</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/fastladder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Быстрая лестница!</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sgs-metals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Металлы!</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Формат имени файла: [<strong>название мода</strong>]-<strong>mc</strong>[версия Minecraft]-<strong>f</strong>[версия Forge]-<strong>v</strong>[версия мода].jar</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Например.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/gottschcore/files/2517954\" rel=\"nofollow\">GottschCore-mc1.12-f14.21.1.2387-v1.2.0.jar</a></span></p>",
